@page "/"
<PageTitle>Tangent Atlas</PageTitle>

@* The home page is the first section only; the menu leads to a page for each of the others. *@
<section class="ta-hero">
    <div class="ta-container ta-hero-inner">
        <div class="ta-hero-head">
            <h1 class="ta-hero-title">A thermostat for <em>all</em> your money.</h1>
            <p class="ta-hero-subtitle">Paychecks, bonuses, checking, savings, credit cards, retirement, investments. Set the temperature, and Tangent Atlas keeps your money from running too hot or too cold.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ta-hero-grid">
            <div class="ta-hero-copy">
                <p class="ta-hero-lead">Connect your online accounts and see everything you own and owe on one dashboard. Measure your portfolio the way professionals do, by risk as well as return. Then diversify using the same published methods as the big index funds.</p>
                <p class="ta-hero-lead">Your house, your rules. Decide how much risk you’re comfortable with, set your rules, and every dollar coming in or going out follows them. Like a thermostat, Tangent Atlas holds the setting you choose. When your life changes, you turn the dial. Sleep at night knowing you have a plan for the future.</p>
                <p class="ta-hero-lead">A plan that only works when the sun is shining is half a plan. What happens when you lose your job, when you can’t make payroll, when you get a margin call? You need cash, and you want to raise it as carefully as you built your portfolio. What do you sell first? What do you sell last? Make raising cash part of your plan.</p>
            </div>

            <RulesPanel />
        </div>

        <div class="ta-page-final ta-home-final">
            <p class="ta-page-close">Keep your bank, your broker and your stocks.</p>
            <AuthorizeView>
                <NotAuthorized>
                    <a href="/signup" class="ta-btn ta-btn-primary ta-btn-large">Sign up</a>
                </NotAuthorized>
            </AuthorizeView>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
